{{also|Taito|taitō}}
==Finnish==

===Etymology===
From {{inh|fi|urj-fin-pro|*taito}} (compare {{cog|vro|taid||sense, reason, grasp, intelligence}}). Equivalent to {{suffix|fi|taitaa|t1=to know, master, command|o}}. Cognate with {{cog|se|dáidu||skill}}.

===Pronunciation===
{{fi-p}}

===Noun===
{{head|fi|noun}}

# [[skill]] {{gloss|capacity to do something well, particularly one who is acquired or learned}}
#: {{uxi|fi|suomen kielen '''taito'''|Finnish language '''skill(s)'''}}
#: {{uxi|fi|'''taito''' selittää vaikeatkin asiat|the '''skill''' of explaining even difficult things}}
# [[art]] {{gloss|skill attained by study, practice, or observation}}
#: {{uxi|fi|elämisen '''taito'''|the '''art''' of living}}

