===Adjective===
{{ttj-adj}}

# [[small]], [[little]]
#: {{syn|ttj|ke|alt1=-ke}}
#: {{ant|ttj|kooto|alt1=-kooto}}

====Usage notes====
When used in the plural, ''-taito'' can mean 'few' or 'small number of', in addition to 'small'. Thus, ''emiti mitaito'' can mean 'small trees' or 'a few trees'.

